<title>USA: Trans Leasing authorizes share buyback.</title>
<headline>Trans Leasing authorizes share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans Leasing International Inc said on Monday its board on Novemer 16 authorized the company to buy back up to one million of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company had 4.0 million average shares outstanding at September 30, when its first fiscal quarter ended.</p>
<p>As of September 30, 344,945 shares had been repurchased at a total cost of $1.2 million under a previous buyback plan that was terminated November 7.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
